            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/30-harness/10-process-overview"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " follows one game from cycle preparation through workers, epoch draft-PR publication, and upstream reconciliation. Read it before the mechanics below."
